	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 『エピソード５／帝国の逆襲』に登場する四足歩行の輸送・戦闘車両「ＡＴ－ＡＴ」がついに登場！",
			"• 徹底したプロップ解析によるディテール再現はもちろん、可動についてもこだわり抜いた1/144スケールプラモデル。",
			"• 脚部各パーツが連動して稼働し、ＡＴ－ＡＴの歩行の様子をリアルに再現。",
			"• 脚部ダンパーパーツも複数付属し、パーツ付け替えでシリンダーの動きも再現。",
			"• 劇中で印象的だった、前のめりに倒れ込んだポーズも取ることができる広い可動域を実現！",
			"• 雪原をイメージした専用ディスプレイベースが付属。複数並べて進軍シーンを再現！",
			"• 全高約160mm。"
		],
		"en": [
			"• The AT-AT, a quadruped transport and combat vehicle that appears in \"Episode 5: The Empire Strikes Back\", is finally here!",
			"• A 1/144 scale plastic model that not only reproduces details through thorough prop analysis, but also focuses on movement.",
			"• Each part of the leg works in tandem to realistically reproduce the walking state of the AT-AT.",
			"• Multiple leg damper parts are also included, and the movement of the cylinder can be reproduced by replacing parts.",
			"• Realizing a wide range of motion that was impressive in the play, where you can take a pose that falls forward!",
			"• Comes with a dedicated display base inspired by a snowfield. Reproduce the marching scene by lining up multiple times!",
			"• Overall height approx. 160mm."
		]
	},
